Kind cluster is installed
Install flux
    #brew install fluxcd/tap/flux
    #flux --version
    #flux check --pre  //check whether your cluster meets Flux's prerequisites
Create a GitHub repository
Create a GitHub token and export it
Bootstrap Flux
   flux bootstrap github \
  --owner=YOUR_USERNAME \
  --repository=<repo-name> \
  --branch=main \
  --path=clusters/<cluster-name> \
  --personal
Verify Flux
   #kubectl get pods -n flux-system
   #flux get all
Now put your application in Git

